OL,3,AFrench PM warns against escalation of
OL,4,Aschool protests after 164 arrested
OL,5,
OL,6,FFrance's Prime Minister Sebastien
OL,7,FLecornu has warned that any escalation
OL,8,Fin the country's current wave of
OL,9,Fstudent protests would be
OL,10,F"irresponsible", following the arrests
OL,11,Fof 164 people on Monday.
OL,13,FThe demonstrations, which began in
OL,14,FParis and have seen teenagers
OL,15,Fblockading their schools for days, stem
OL,16,Ffrom issues including overcrowded
OL,17,Fclasses and teacher shortages.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,316,300,200,140,0,100
